        {
          "id": 684459305,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "@pquantin, thank you for looking,\n\nI am aware of the functionality and I used it before as well as a more convenient variant of add_group_mask_entry() that I have created (static to NVME).\n\nMy problem here that I have a branching condition and I need to decode the the Event Information based on Event type (that can be error, smart, notice, io set (NVME) or vendor specific).\n\nIn the absence of a functionality that allows a custom field expansion of one of the entries from the array, I cannot use either function. I have tried to add such functionality in the past, but it was not accepted.\n\nI can try again, if there is an interest, but this is better to be aother merge request.",
          "author": {
            "id": 8151300,
            "username": "constg2021",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Constantine Gavrilov",
            "state": "active",
